<html>
  <body>
    <h1>Bizzlo Counselor Call Scripts</h1>
    <h2>Profile Qualification</h2>
    <p>Confirm destination, budget, academics, English score, intake, and document readiness.</p>
    <h2>Shortlist Presentation</h2>
    <p>Explain partner-linked options, entry requirements, timelines, and next documents needed.</p>
    <h2>Document Follow-up</h2>
    <p>Ask for missing documents by exact type and tell the student where the file is blocked.</p>
    <h2>Offer and Deposit</h2>
    <p>Confirm offer conditions, payment deadline, visa stage, and finance proof readiness.</p>
  </body>
</html>
